## Concept map
`Task → RAG → Tools → Agent Loop → Memory/State → Verification → Telemetry/Evaluation → Release`

## BUILD
Use the framework-free AegisAI kernel from `app` to model tenant-scoped tasks, authorized tools and evidence verification.

```python
from app import AegisAI, Evidence, Task

a = AegisAI()
task = Task("investigate customer issue", "tenant-a", allowed_tools={"search"})
print(a.authorize(task, "search"))
print(a.verify(task, [Evidence("policy-1", "authoritative policy")]))
```

